# Google Sign-In (Google Identity Services). Leave blank to hide the button —
# the rest of the app works fine without it. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# (type: Web application) at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# and add http://localhost:5173 as an authorized JavaScript origin.
# This must be the SAME client ID as GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in backend/.env.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
